desc:ReaProof Serialize (well-behaved)
// GOOD reference subject for the serialize checks: the payload derives ONLY
// from parameter state (stable across repeated saves), and the read path
// tolerates a truncated stream - file_var() on an exhausted stream yields 0
// into an INTERNAL variable, never into a slider, so a corrupted project
// restores at defaults instead of garbage.

slider1:0<-24,24,0.01>Gain (dB)

in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output

@init
stored = 0;

@slider
gain = 10^(slider1/20);
stored = slider1;

@sample
spl0 *= gain;
spl1 *= gain;

@serialize
file_var(0, stored);
